@startuml
actor TeamLeader
boundary GroupCreationPage
control GroupController
control GroupService
database Database

TeamLeader -> GroupCreationPage: Enter group details (project name, description, objectives)
GroupCreationPage -> GroupController: Submit group details

GroupController -> GroupService: Request to create group with details
GroupService -> GroupService: Validate group details
GroupService -> Database: Save group details
Database --> GroupService: Return save status

alt Group creation successful
    GroupService -> GroupController: Confirm group creation
    GroupController --> GroupCreationPage: Display success message
    GroupCreationPage -> TeamLeader: Show success message
else Group creation failed
    GroupService --> GroupController: Return error status
    GroupController --> GroupCreationPage: Display error message
    GroupCreationPage -> TeamLeader: Show error message
end

TeamLeader -> GroupCreationPage: View and manage group settings (if applicable)

@enduml